be who uses the island to sacrifice tribesman to their gods. During time their relationship changes from master-slave to a mutual respected friendship despite their difference in culture and religion.","rating":{"sources":[{"title":"IMDb","logo":"https://a7.pnghunt.com/preview/450/662/555/computer-wallpaper-text-brand-yellow-imdb.jpg","max_value":10,"value":6}],"value":6,"age":"PG-13"},"episode_id":1278,"content_control":"FAMILY"}}